{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-04","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"spst_16-04","title":"无前","storyCode":"EG-10","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-04.txt","sourceHash":"35e4ef0c88a0b22ac8f80814905a153dedeb869b6bc7eb5a3d94ad79f6733c84","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"善人的布施，终将抵达大地的每一个角落。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼......呼......\n疼......石头在肉里疯长......几乎能听见声音。为什么我还没死掉？\n没有力气，四肢不受控制......跑！往东跑！\n往南是送死，往北也是送死。往西......如果远北都出事了，西部那些矿场也不可能幸免。\n可逃跑能逃出远北......又要逃到哪里才能逃出痛苦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北边界，荒野</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跑......不动......了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就到，这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边好像有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不，请让我去吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远处的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉到那只是一个受过许多苦痛的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脱力，脱水，许久未曾进食......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，他也是我们的同胞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请您救救他吧，就像您救我们所有人一样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再一次施行您的神迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是神迹......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病不是使他如此痛苦的主要原因，我只能使他不再因疾病而疼痛，却不能使他饱腹、给他干净的水喝、让他有安全的地方入睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法施行神迹，我并非全能，我只是......相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您总是这样谦逊，我们都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生，您还能听见我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我会握住您的手......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信吧。相信我们的生命。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信我们的身体与思维，相信我们心脏的每一次律动，相信我们肺叶的每一次收放。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信我们自身，是一切力量的来源。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从此，您不必再生活在对死亡的恐惧中。"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石在体内迅速生长带来的疼痛逐渐远去。\n他仍能听见那些声音，却不再因此疼得辗转反侧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你救了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我该怎么，感谢你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以像这里所有的兄弟姊妹一样，称呼我为“希尔达”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神迹——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达再一次救了我们的同胞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她救了我们所有人，只是用母亲一样的抚摸，就像刚才一样，抹去了所有的病痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"许多人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希尔达......希尔达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，那是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你长什么模样？无论是你，还是其他说话的人，我都看不清......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的头上有伤，是跑得太急，在哪里跌了一跤，将头都撞破了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是脑中的淤血让您看不清。没关系，我们可以搀扶着您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，您接下来要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就先同我们一起吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您要带我们去一个没有痛苦的地方，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，只要你们仍愿意与我同行......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g9_seasurface_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希尔达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我们相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
